<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Unified Dental</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
    .card { max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .logo-text { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #0f766e; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #0f766e; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 15px; }
    .btn-secondary { display: inline-block; background-color: #64748b; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 13px; }
    .info-box { background-color: #f0fdfa; border: 1px solid #99f6e4; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .info-box strong { color: #0f766e; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; text-align: center; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo-text">🦷 Unified Dental Platform</div>
    </div>
    <h2>Welcome, {{name}}!</h2>
    <p>You have been invited to join <strong>{{tenantName}}</strong> on the Unified Dental Platform. Your administrator account has been created and is ready to use.</p>

    <div class="info-box">
      <strong>Organization:</strong> {{tenantName}}<br>
      {{#if subdomainUrl}}
      <strong>Workspace Subdomain:</strong> <a href="{{subdomainUrl}}" style="color: #0f766e; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">{{subdomainUrl}}</a><br>
      {{/if}}
      <strong>Role:</strong> {{#if roleName}}{{roleName}}{{else}}Tenant Administrator{{/if}}
    </div>

    {{#if hasResetToken}}
    <p>To get started, please set your password by clicking the button below:</p>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{setPasswordUrl}}" class="btn">Set Your Password</a>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">This link will expire in 24 hours. If it expires, you can request a new one from the login page using "Forgot Password".</p>
    <hr class="divider">
    {{/if}}

    <p>Once your password is set, you can log in to your organization workspace:</p>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn-secondary">Go to Login Page</a>
    </div>

    <p>If you have any questions, reach out to your organization administrator.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; 2026 Unified Dental SaaS Platform. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
